<div class="pl-comb">{%- assign cp = all_products["vitex-extracto"] -%}{%- if cp.id -%}<a href="{{ cp.url }}"><div><div class="circ">{%- if cp.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ cp.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 }}" loading="lazy" alt="{{ cp.title | escape }}">{%- else -%}<span class="ini">{{ cp.title | slice: 0 }}</span>{%- endif -%}</div></div><div><span class="lab">Ciclo</span><b>{{ cp.title }}</b><span>Botanicals · fruto</span></div></a>{%- endif -%}{%- assign cp = all_products["ashwagandha-organico-capsulas-extracto"] -%}{%- if cp.id -%}<a href="{{ cp.url }}"><div><div class="circ">{%- if cp.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ cp.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 }}" loading="lazy" alt="{{ cp.title | escape }}">{%- else -%}<span class="ini">{{ cp.title | slice: 0 }}</span>{%- endif -%}</div></div><div><span class="lab">Estrés</span><b>{{ cp.title }}</b><span>Botanicals · raíz</span></div></a>{%- endif -%}{%- assign cp = all_products["moon-rose-balance"] -%}{%- if cp.id -%}<a href="{{ cp.url }}"><div><div class="circ">{%- if cp.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ cp.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 }}" loading="lazy" alt="{{ cp.title | escape }}">{%- else -%}<span class="ini">{{ cp.title | slice: 0 }}</span>{%- endif -%}</div></div><div><span class="lab">Ritual</span><b>{{ cp.title }}</b><span>Rituals · blend</span></div></a>{%- endif -%}</div>
</section>

<section id="s5" class="pl-warn" aria-labelledby="at">
<div class="cell"><span class="lab">Antes de tomarlo</span><h2 id="at" class="disp h2" style="max-width: 12ch">Lo que debes saber.</h2></div>
<div class="pl-wl">
<details class="pl-acc"><summary><span>No se recomienda si…</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Estás embarazada o lactando.</li><li>Eres menor de 18 años.</li></ul></div></details>
<details class="pl-acc"><summary><span>Consulta a tu médico antes si…</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Tomas anticonceptivos o terapia hormonal.</li></ul></div></details>
<details class="pl-acc"><summary><span>Cómo guardarlo</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ab"><p>Lejos de la luz y la humedad, a temperatura ambiente. Dura hasta 36 meses en buenas condiciones. La fecha de caducidad viene impresa en cada frasco.</p></div></details>
<p class="small"><a class="tlink" href="https://wa.me/523316035820" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp para consultas sobre adaptógenos o dosis</a></p><p class="small"></p>
</div>
